# Agent docs

- Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before making substantial changes.
- Use `docs/architecture.md`, `docs/database.md`, and `docs/pdf.md` as the source of truth for stack and ops.
- When completing a large migration or architectural change, add or update a dated markdown file under `docs/` (`YYYY-MM-DD-*.md`) and keep the living docs current.
- Never commit secrets from `.env`.
